For each scenario (s) and time interval (t ∈ T= {1, . . ., 24}), the operational vector
includes the following:
• PWT
s,t : Actual dispatched wind power (MWh);
• PEL
s,t : Power consumption of the electrolyzer (MWh);
• mH2
s,t : Hydrogen production rate (Nm3);
• SH2
s,t : State of Charge (SoC) of the hydrogen tank (Nm3);
• Pgrid,buy
s,t /Pgrid,sell
s,t : Power purchased from/sold to the utility grid (MWh);
• PFC
s,t : Power generation from the fuel cell (MWh);
• σs,t: Vector of slack variables for load shedding (ensuring feasibility).
